comply with all applicable Belizean laws, including but not limited to:

- The Financial Services Commission regulations
- Anti-Money Laundering and Terrorist Financing Prevention Act
- Data Protection Act
- Digital Identity and Authentication Framework
- Blockchain and Digital Assets Regulatory Framework

For commercial use within Belize's jurisdiction, additional licensing and
compliance requirements may apply. Contact the relevant Belizean authorities
for guidance on regulatory compliance.